  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/EUProDealsImbalance/Definitions?rev=' id='Definitions' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/EUProDealsImbalance' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='text-orientation' id='dash-text_22' value='-90' />
          <format attr='text-align' id='dash-text_22' value='center' />
          <format attr='text-align' id='dash-text_36' value='center' />
          <format attr='text-orientation' id='dash-text_36' value='-90' />
          <format attr='text-align' id='dash-text_49' value='center' />
          <format attr='text-orientation' id='dash-text_49' value='-90' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='parameter-ctrl'>
          <format attr='font-size' value='8' />
          <format attr='color' value='#333333' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='parameter-ctrl-title'>
          <format attr='font-size' value='8' />
          <format attr='color' value='#333333' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1200' minheight='800' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='5' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='100000' id='4' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>General:</run>
              <run>

This dashboard, named &quot;Pro Deals Imbalance,&quot; enables you to effectively monitor imbalanced deals within the EU region. An imbalanced deal refers to a situation where a deal offers less attractiveness to users compared to a non-pro deal.
Pro deal is a subscription discount deal set in MMT.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Data:</run>
              <run>
- pandata_report.regional_eu_pro_deals_imbalance table feeds this dashboard
- Data is based on fulfillment-dwh-production.pandata_curated and fulfillment-dwh-production.pandata_report.
- </run>
              <run italic='true'>regional_eu_agg_vendors</run>
              <run>, </run>
              <run italic='true'>pd_discounts</run>
              <run> tables are the base table for this report.


</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Definitions:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>disc_imbalance_flag</run>
              <run>: The value is &apos;Direct Dist Imbalance&apos; if the non-pro discount is higher or equal to the pro discount. It is also not a free delivery (pro and non-pro deal), and the discount type (e.g., percentage) is the same for both the pro and non-pro discount. The value is &apos;Indirect Imbalance&apos; if the discount type is not the same for the non-pro and pro users, for example, the non-pro discount is of &apos;percentage&apos; type, but the pro discount isn&apos;t.

</run>
              <run bold='true'>mov_imbalance_flag</run>
              <run>: If the discount type is the same, we check if the non-pro users have lower MOV values. We flag the problematic ones with the value &apos;MOV Imbalance&apos;.

</run>
              <run bold='true'>disc_pro_check</run>
              <run>: Its value is &quot;disc Review&quot; when the vendor should be checked due to the local entry-level discount amount.

</run>
              <run bold='true'>mov_pro_check</run>
              <run>: Its value is &quot;MOV Review&quot; when the vendor should be checked due to the local entry-level MOV (Minimum Order Value).

</run>
              <run bold='true'>deal_status</run>
              <run>: It can be a &apos;FUTURE DEAL&apos; or a &apos;LIVE DEAL&apos; based on the discount&apos;s start and end date.

</run>
              <run bold='true'>non pro duration</run>
              <run>: the difference in days between the start and end date of the non-pro discount (indicating how long the non-pro discount will be available).</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7375' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98600' x='1000' y='1250'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='24'>Definitions</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#df1067' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='73' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='72' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='100000' id='4' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>General:</run>
                    <run>

This dashboard, named &quot;Pro Deals Imbalance,&quot; enables you to effectively monitor imbalanced deals within the EU region. An imbalanced deal refers to a situation where a deal offers less attractiveness to users compared to a non-pro deal.
Pro deal is a subscription discount deal set in MMT.

</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Data:</run>
                    <run>
- pandata_report.regional_eu_pro_deals_imbalance table feeds this dashboard
- Data is based on fulfillment-dwh-production.pandata_curated and fulfillment-dwh-production.pandata_report.
- </run>
                    <run italic='true'>regional_eu_agg_vendors</run>
                    <run>, </run>
                    <run italic='true'>pd_discounts</run>
                    <run> tables are the base table for this report.


</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Definitions:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>disc_imbalance_flag</run>
                    <run>: The value is &apos;Direct Dist Imbalance&apos; if the non-pro discount is higher or equal to the pro discount. It is also not a free delivery (pro and non-pro deal), and the discount type (e.g., percentage) is the same for both the pro and non-pro discount. The value is &apos;Indirect Imbalance&apos; if the discount type is not the same for the non-pro and pro users, for example, the non-pro discount is of &apos;percentage&apos; type, but the pro discount isn&apos;t.

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>mov_imbalance_flag</run>
                    <run>: If the discount type is the same, we check if the non-pro users have lower MOV values. We flag the problematic ones with the value &apos;MOV Imbalance&apos;.

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>disc_pro_check</run>
                    <run>: Its value is &quot;disc Review&quot; when the vendor should be checked due to the local entry-level discount amount.

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>mov_pro_check</run>
                    <run>: Its value is &quot;MOV Review&quot; when the vendor should be checked due to the local entry-level MOV (Minimum Order Value).

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>deal_status</run>
                    <run>: It can be a &apos;FUTURE DEAL&apos; or a &apos;LIVE DEAL&apos; based on the discount&apos;s start and end date.

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>non pro duration</run>
                    <run>: the difference in days between the start and end date of the non-pro discount (indicating how long the non-pro discount will be available).</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7375' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98600' x='1000' y='1250'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='24'>Definitions</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#df1067' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{A5996692-3D33-4F5F-AEB2-E5C99DFB25E4}' />
    </dashboard>
